      "id": "claim_63f9d3b3b26d4770beaf3dd45e469ed6",
      "statement": "The app detects whether apiUrl points to a valid Ulabase service URL (validated by isValidApiBaseUrl). If not, it shows a 'Connect your service' screen instead of the full app. This prevents route guards from running against a non-existent backend.",
