      "id": "claim_e6372ebf46134772869598f512b3ef71",
      "statement": "The route guard system uses authGuard (protects authenticated routes, redirects to /auth/login if no session), publicGuard (protects auth pages, redirects into app if already signed in), and /invitations/accept is deliberately unguarded to work for signed-out invitees, signed-in users, and new accounts.",
